      "publication": "Burlington Code of Ordinances including Charter and appendices"
    },
    {
      "html": "<p class=\"P1\">Areas posted as \"Restricted Parking\" may be used only by clearly marked emergency vehicles or vehicles authorized in writing by the airport manager.</p>\n<p class=\"HistoryNote\">(Res. of 3-24-97)</p>",
      "text": "Areas posted as \"Restricted Parking\" may be used only by clearly marked emergency vehicles or vehicles authorized in writing by the airport manager. (Res. of 3-24-97)",
