      "publication": "Burlington Code of Ordinances including Charter and appendices"
    },
    {
      "html": "<p class=\"P1\">Parking which in any way obstructs vehicular or pedestrian traffic or creates a hazard is prohibited.</p>\n<p class=\"HistoryNote\">(Res. of 3-24-97)</p>",
      "text": "Parking which in any way obstructs vehicular or pedestrian traffic or creates a hazard is prohibited. (Res. of 3-24-97)",
