    {
      "html": "<p class=\"P1\">No person shall park any vehicle in any parking space designated by the airport for parking for persons with disabilities unless the vehicle displays valid special registration plates or removable windowshield placards issued pursuant to <a href=\"http://legislature.vermont.gov/statutes/title/23\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">23</a> V.S.A. § <a href=\"http://legislature.vermont.gov/statutes/section/23/007/00304a\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">304a</a>, or any amendment or renumbering thereof.</p>\n<p class=\"HistoryNote\">(Res. of 3-24-97; Reg. of 1-8-25, eff. 2-5-25)</p>",
      "text": "No person shall park any vehicle in any parking space designated by the airport for parking for persons with disabilities unless the vehicle displays valid special registration plates or removable windowshield placards issued pursuant to 23 V.S.A. § 304a, or any amendment or renumbering thereof. (Res. of 3-24-97; Reg. of 1-8-25, eff. 2-5-25)",
