    {
      "html": "<p class=\"P1\">In addition to these general regulations, the airport may further regulate parking by posting signs or notices. Parking in violation of any sign or notice is prohibited.</p>\n<p class=\"HistoryNote\">(Res. of 3-24-97)</p>",
      "text": "In addition to these general regulations, the airport may further regulate parking by posting signs or notices. Parking in violation of any sign or notice is prohibited. (Res. of 3-24-97)",
