      "id": "https://www.codepublishing.com/VT/Burlington/#!/BurlingtonAxE/BurlingtonAxE0202.html::html-id:2.10",
      "heading": "[Responsibility of operator.]",
      "path": [
        "",
        "",
        "ARTICLE II. GENERAL PARKING REGULATIONS"
